---
import CertificateIcon from '../assets/icons/solid/certificate.svg';
---

<section class="card bg-base-100 border border-base-300 shadow-sm">
  <div class="card-body">
    <h2 class="card-title text-2xl font-semibold flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
      <CertificateIcon
        class="h-7 w-7 shrink-0 fill-primary"
        aria-label="Certificate icon"
      />
      Certifications
    </h2>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-3">
      <div
        class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
      >
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1.5">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-0.5">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">
              Artificial Intelligence General Awareness
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
              Veritas Technologies LLC • April 2024
            </p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
            Comprehensive overview of AI fundamentals, machine learning
            concepts, and practical applications in enterprise environments.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
      >
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1.5">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-0.5">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Go - The Complete Guide</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">
              Academind • February 2024
            </p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
            Mastered Go programming language fundamentals, concurrency patterns,
            and building scalable backend services.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
      >
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1.5">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-0.5">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">
              Master NestJS - The JavaScript Node.js Framework
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">Udemy • September 2021</p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
            Advanced training in NestJS framework including dependency
            injection, modules, middleware, and building enterprise-grade REST
            APIs.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
      >
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1.5">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-0.5">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Angular: Securing Apps</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">LinkedIn • October 2020</p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
            Best practices for securing Angular applications including
            authentication, authorization, and protecting against common
            vulnerabilities.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="relative rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-5 py-4"
      >
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-1.5">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-y-0.5">
            <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">
              JavaScript: Security Essentials
            </h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70">LinkedIn • October 2020</p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-base-content/80 leading-relaxed">
            Essential security practices for JavaScript development including
            XSS prevention, secure coding patterns, and vulnerability
            mitigation.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
